# Product

Vision Studio turns a musical idea (text, audio, MIDI, or a track) into editable layers generated by Stable Audio 3.

- An agent fills a song brief. If it lacks information, ask one question at a time.
- Every question offers: an answer, You decide, Skip this, Skip all and build.
- Skip all and build always produces a prompt, however little input is given. The render action is Build.
- Output options: drums, chords, bass, melody, texture, all layers separately, full mix.
- Never ask tempo. Derive it from mood and energy, or detect it from audio.
- Each layer returns 3 variations.
